#
# Conformance case: characteristic/symmetric-mirror
# Property-characteristic enforcement (H4) — symmetric mirroring.
#
# ex:counter is typed logic:symmetricProperty. Given ex:A counter ex:B, the
# native characteristic pass must derive the mirror ex:B counter ex:A.
# The chase seeds only from input.nq; this is the mirror axiom.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/characteristic/symmetric-mirror/> .

ex:counter a logic:symmetricProperty .
ex:A ex:counter ex:B .
